  "description": "Water rations are the colony's everyday expression of survival. They are what windtraps, condensers, wild harvests, and hauling jobs eventually become: drinkable time.\n\nBecause the mod gives water its own need and logistics loop, every ration feels more important than a generic meal stack. It is the unit that turns desert infrastructure into something a pawn can actually carry across Arrakis.",
